WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.310
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:06.320
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.900
Kanzaki Mizuki's new super idol trio unit, Tristar.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.080
The elimination audition is finally coming to a close.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.580
The black ship that came from the sky, Ichinose Kaede,

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.600
is currently promoting Tristar in Shanghai after becoming its second member.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.090
Nihao!

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.160
The clock is ticking down until the For Real Final Audition.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.590
Tune in at noon tomorrow.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.360
Things are really heating up.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.310
You said it.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:42.480
The two of you are making such scary faces.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.870
Same to you.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.730
<i>Tomorrow, only one of us</i>

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.210
<i>will be chosen as the last member of Tristar.</i>

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:32.500
Tristar's schedule is already filled up for the next several years.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.510
We can't delay this any longer.

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:38.450
I know. After tomorrow's audition ends,

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:40.390
I'll announce the final member.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:45.490
How do you plan on choosing between those three? {it's weird if she doesn't actually say their names}

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.730
Whoever shows me the greatest inability to fail

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.150
will be the one I choose.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.900
Inability to fail?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.530
See you later!

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.780
Love you!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.780
Have a safe trip.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.790
They really don't seem like they're about to compete as enemies tomorrow.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.290
Suzukawa-sama, wherever are you taking them?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.170
Does this place really exist on the same campus we live on?

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.620
It looks like the president might live here.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.730
Suzukawa-san, where is this?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.320
Address your questions to him.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.510
Welcome, honeys!

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.020
This is for VIPs!

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:34.020
Only used for our most important visitors, the White Guest House!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.940
Students aren't normally allowed to enter here, but—!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.390
This time is special!

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:45.810
Mizuki and the Headmistress decided to allow you to stay here in preparation for the audition!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.200
Okay! Good job, me!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:53.050
How are we supposed to prepare if we don't know what's coming?

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:56.700
Sensei, please tell us what tomorrow's audition will be like.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.550
Singing or dancing or rock-paper-scissors...

00:03:58.550 --> 00:03:59.910
At least a hint!

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.220
Please.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.720
That's top secret. {I think this'd be fine...}

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.790
I'm not allowed to tell you anything.

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:06.720
Come on...

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.380
Do you think he just doesn't know?

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.480
Probably.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.860
No! You're likely to spill everything once they ask about it.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:18.110
I promise I won't tell!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.670
Sensei!

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.860
Take them to their rooms!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.820
We're in different rooms?

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.170
Yes. You'll remain on your own during your stay here.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.830
And, Aikatsu Phones, please.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.430
Until the end of the audition, {This change feels so useless}

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:42.090
I'll be taking care of your phones for you.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.080
Good luck, honeys.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.520
This is so amazing!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:55.350
It feels like such a waste to have a room this nice all to myself.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.710
Angely Sugar rare dress cards! {the cards are the dress, right?}

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:06.240
<i>To you three who have fought your way to the end of the Tristar audition.</i>

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.990
<i>We present you with these newly-designed dresses.</i>

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.540
<i>Each brand's top designer</i>

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:18.440
<i>has watched your valiant efforts and specially prepared a rare dress.</i>

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.080
<i>Upon the name of your brand, 
do not falter or lose your nerve.</i>

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.740
<i>We have great expectations for you in this final audition.</i>

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.550
I'll give everything I have!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:36.060
I don't even know where the other two rooms are.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.500
I'm sure they're not taking a break from training even now.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.320
I shouldn't disturb them.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.060
Did they come?

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.070
Coming!

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.470
I have come with your supper.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.260
Oh well, guess nobody's around...

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.430
Everyone, let's do our best tomorrow. {"everyone"...} {it's fine}

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.930
It doesn't matter who wins tomorrow.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.800
We'll have no regrets.

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:26.940
Today we watch the final battleground.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.380
The curtain will now rise on the Tristar elimination audition,

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:32.450
the For Real Final Audition's first stage!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.950
Entry number one, Hoshimiya Ichigo-san, please step on stage!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:39.710
Onee-chan's going first!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.790
I can't see...

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:47.210
Hoshimiya Ichigo-san.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.220
Please come to center stage.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:52.710
A chair?

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.200
Please take a seat.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.220
Y-Yes!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.230
<i>Is this what I think it is?</i>

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.730
The public interview will now begin.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.730
Public... interview?

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.410
Hoshimiya-san.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.300
Yes!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:15.240
Please tell us your thoughts on being one of the final three participants in Tristar's audition.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.120
M-My thoughts are...

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.390
Th-They, I...

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.500
I can't...

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.260
Are you alright, Hoshimiya?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.810
Yes! My thoughts are...

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:39.240
I'm super happy about having come this far after Aoi, Ran, and I trained so hard together.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:43.270
I'm going to do everything I can not to let them down!

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.780
You may have been asked this before,

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.280
but is it correct to assume that it was because of Kiriya Aoi-san's encouragements

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.650
that you transferred into this school?

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.780
That's right.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:56.450
Aoi was also the one who invited me to your concert

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.330
back before I knew anything about idols.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.790
If Aoi hadn't dragged me along with her,

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.710
I wouldn't be up here right now.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:10.210
As a transfer student, what was the trigger that started your relationship with Shibuki Ran-san?

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.970
I was a bit scared of Ran at first...

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.470
<i>Be careful not to disappear together.</i>

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:22.090
But Ran was the one who made me realize how much I wanted to join those amazing idols.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:25.980
She blew away my hesitation and strengthened my resolve. {this isn't much better, is it?}

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.480
You've found yourself some wonderful friends.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.240
That's the one thing I have absolute confidence in!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:35.740
But you now have to struggle and fight with those same friends for a single chair.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:37.800
This isn't...

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.780
This isn't <i>just</i> a chair.

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:44.950
Because you're my... you're everyone's idol.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:49.330
It's our dream to become part of Tristar.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:52.260
That's why I can fight while still cheering for my friends.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.370
Last question.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:09:00.510
If you were to enter Tristar, what sort of radiance would you bring along?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:07.310
If I were to stand on the same stage as my idol Mizuki-san and the powerful Kaede-chan...

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.020
<i>But if you keep biting onto me like a soft-shelled turtle...</i>

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.320
<i>Hoshimiya Ichigo, you might be able to become...</i>

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.060
The sun.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:18.010
I'll become Tristar's sun

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.530
and shine all the way from morning till night!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:27.790
What could it be...

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:32.700
What sort of necessary ability is Mizuki trying to draw out from the final member...

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:36.830
Tsukikage-san, as her manager, I'm sure you already know.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.480
No, she hasn't told me either.

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:40.300
However...

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.310
I think I have an idea.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:45.740
For Real Final Audition, entry number two!

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.340
Kiriya Aoi-san, please take the stage!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.170
Yes!

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:53.030
What Mizuki is searching for

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:58.530
is the strength to shine alone even within the Tristar unit.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.040
Now then, Kiriya-san.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:08.870
Please tell us your thoughts on being one of the final three participants in Tristar's audition.

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:12.150
Hoshimiya Ichigo and Shibuki Ran.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.920
I'm unbelievably happy that we've all made it this far. {there's a German Starcraft caster who uses "unbelievable" as an adverb all the time}

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.200
If you were to put those feelings into a metaphor?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:25.180
I feel like a hamster who's caught between a snake and a mongoose.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.190
That was a wonderful analogy.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.610
Nicely done.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.110
On to my next question.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.690
Your reputation as the Idol Professor precedes you.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:43.670
Through your eyes, what is your opinion on Hoshimiya-san and Shibuki-san's ability as idols?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.590
Of course.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:50.620
Ichigo's strong point is how she can excite her fans with her "leap before you look" personality. {I am currently leading a crusade against single quotes used like this}

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:55.670
On the other hand, Ran's multifaceted personality of both being a charismatic character who does everything perfectly

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:00.770
as well as sometimes showing a soft, cute expression leaves her fans always wanting more.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:04.450
Nee-san, you always know exactly what to say!

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.090
Last question.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:12.650
If you were to enter Tristar, what sort of radiance would you bring along?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:18.400
I know more than anybody else about idols and the industry from both research and personal experience.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:23.530
I'm like a tin can packed with everything there is to know about entertainment! {I don't like the image sponges induce}

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:27.910
I'll use every last bit of knowledge I have to make Tristar shine as brilliantly as possible!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.290
Interesting answer.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:34.290
"If you were to enter Tristar,

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:38.170
what sort of radiance would you bring"... Correct?

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:42.540
As someone who has spent her entire life in this industry,

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.680
you are the shining example of having an entertainment career.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:48.340
To me, the stage is where I belong.

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:51.130
No matter who stands beside me, or whom I'm paired with,

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.690
even if that happens to be Tristar,

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.690
Shibuki Ran will not change.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.700
Thank you. That's all.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:08.040
The first stage of Tristar's For Real Final Audition,

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.710
Kanzaki Mizuki's public interview is now over.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.450
Ran!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.920
There you are!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.710
Ichigo! Aoi!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.640
Looks like we're on break until tonight.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:26.550
We shouldn't relax too much or we won't be ready for the next stage live audition.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.310
Look, they're replaying scenes from before!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.810
It's Tristar's night.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:38.260
This audition is being promoted around the world from Asia to the Americas!

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:43.070
New songs and other things will be released non-stop for the next 20 weeks!

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.280
Don't look away even for an instant!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.970
The live audition starts tonight at 5:00.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.720
Who will become the final member?

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.660
Seems like it'll get busier for whoever wins.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.620
Do you really think that's all?

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:03.010
Forget about weeks, we may not be able to meet again for the next few years...

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.170
What?!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.340
I'm surprised you're so surprised.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.470
We won't meet for years?

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:10.510
It's definitely possible.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:18.290
Ichigo...

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.070
Way to ruin the mood.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.630
I can't help it, I'm hungry.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.940
Certainly.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:27.490
I'm kinda in the mood for cake... you know?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:31.120
The result will be announced right after the live audition.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.090
Then there's the press conference...

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:36.250
It'll be so busy that there'll be no time for cake.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.880
Then we need to act now!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.480
Who knows when we'll get this chance again?

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.510
Sounds good.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.880
Let's go for it.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.900
They're out of cake...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.120
Leave it to me!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.780
I'll bake us some delicious pancakes!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:15.140
My mom would make these from time to time when she wasn't running the shop.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:16.270
You're too good.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.290
We just can't win.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.410
Here we go!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.550
And, now!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.070
Don't you think this is a little too big?

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.560
It's like a cheese wheel.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:34.260
That was the smallest pan there was.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.670
What about maple syrup?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:38.680
It'll be plenty sweet with all the sugar I used.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.810
I'm starving, let's hurry up and eat.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.860
I'll split it up into thirds. {if this wasn't such a serious episode, I'd be hoping so hard that the other girls would walk in one after another, Zetsubou-sensei style}

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.350
It's so fluffy!

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.090
It tastes better than it looks.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:55.290
Doesn't it? I bet I could eat ten whole pancakes like this.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.140
T-Ten?!

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.270
Maybe eleven...

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:03.340
Why are you laughing? Did I say something funny?

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.800
No...

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.300
It's just that you don't get nervous at all, Ichigo.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.080
No way!

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.780
My legs were shaking through the whole interview,

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.720
and my head went totally blank.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.900
I got butterflies in my stomach too.

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:16.720
Same here.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.230
But then I heard you two inside my head...

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:23.720
<i>Just be yourself, Ichigo.</i>

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.730
<i>Don't worry about showing off.</i>

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:32.950
It was all thanks to you two that I was able to make it through the interview.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.550
I can't hear a shred of gratitude in those words.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.530
Yeah, you should be more grateful.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:39.250
I'm plenty grateful!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.660
Then take this bite.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.380
This is probably the last time we'll be like this.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.130
Ran...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.140
Got'cha!

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.140
Me too!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.810
Would the participants of the Tristar audition,

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:10.670
Hoshimiya Ichigo, Kiriya Aoi, and Shibuki Ran

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.840
please proceed to the stage's waiting room.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.040
I repeat:

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.840
Would the participants of the Tristar audition,

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.320
Hoshimiya Ichigo, Kiriya Aoi, and Shibuki Ran...

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.290
Let's go.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.310
Please show us a concert filled with love.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.680
You're representing all of us here,

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.180
so if you dare back down now, I'll suck your blood.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.820
Everyone...

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.180
Thank you.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.000
Now everyone, please raise your hands.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.020
One, and—!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.060
Aikatsu!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.720
I will now announce the results of the elimination audition.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.460
The final member of Tristar will be...

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.900
Shibuki Ran!

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:21.450
In today's audition, Shibuki Ran once again showed her high level of professionalism.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.140
Among everyone in the academy,

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.700
Ran-san...

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:24.450
Yeah.

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:27.490
she alone has history to back up her ability.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.370
In determining the requisites to join this unit,

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:35.880
I decided that each member must have the strength to shine even when alone.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.280
During the audition, only Shibuki Ran

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.350
exuded such a professional aura.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:46.860
She is truly fit to bring the light that I desire to Tristar.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.340
The best picture I could ever take.

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:54.180
You did it, Ran.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.090
We're running out of time until the press conference.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.410
I'm sorry, but please give me some more time...

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.540
Ichigo! Aoi!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.420
Ran!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:18.930
Sorry!

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:19.970
Please let us through!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:27.430
You know, that pancake was really delicious.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.510
Ran...

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:32.930
Come on now, you're not acting like the Shibuki Ran I know.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:35.480
I-I can't help it...

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.440
It's the second time...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.950
That I've had to leave my friends...

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:41.860
Ran.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:46.520
The runway is a road you walk down, 
carrying the feelings of lots of people.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:48.760
You're the one who taught me that.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:53.120
Take on Ichigo, my, and everyone else's feelings

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.650
and take off, Ran!

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:56.780
Smile, Ran!

00:23:55.710 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.870
Weren't you nervous during the interview?

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:02.180
Of course I was.

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:05.570
But even if I tried to hide it, Mizuki-san could see right through me.

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:07.380
You said it!

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:09.880
Be yourself during interviews!

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:14.130
Ichigo, Aoi, I'm a member of Tristar starting today.

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:17.180
Shibuki won't be returning back to this dorm.

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:18.220
What?

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:19.990
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.990 --> 00:24:21.690
Tristar Takeoff! {unless there's a reason I am unaware of}

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:26.030
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
